{"id":"u60","kelas":"kerja","no":13,"judul":"Perjalanan Dinas","title":"Business Travel","emoji":"✈️","ringkas":"Bandara, hotel, transportasi, dan menjamu rekan","ready":true,"goals":["memakai bahasa Inggris di **bandara**: check-in, keamanan, boarding, dan bagasi","memesan, check-in, dan check-out **hotel**, serta meminta layanan","bertanya arah dan memakai **transportasi** (taksi, kereta, kendaraan daring)","menjamu rekan kerja dari luar negeri: menjemput, menawarkan makan, dan mengantar","membuat dan membahas **itinerary** (jadwal perjalanan) serta pengeluaran dinas","menangani masalah perjalanan: penundaan, bagasi hilang, dan perubahan jadwal"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Perjalanan dinas melibatkan banyak percakapan singkat: di bandara, hotel, taksi, dan restoran. Dengan kalimat yang tepat, perjalananmu lebih lancar dan kamu tampil profesional. Kamu juga akan belajar menyambut rekan dari luar negeri."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Di bandara","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Check-in","[[I'd like to check in for the flight to Singapore.]] / [[Here is my passport and e-ticket.]]"],["Bagasi","[[I have one bag to check in.]] / [[This is my carry-on.]]"],["Kursi","[[Could I have a window seat, please?]] / [[Is it possible to have an aisle seat?]]"],["Keamanan","[[Please put your laptop in the tray.]] / [[Please remove your belt.]]"],["Boarding","[[Which gate does the flight leave from?]] / [[Boarding starts at 9:30.]]"],["Imigrasi","[[What's the purpose of your visit?]] — [[I'm here on business.]]"],["Penundaan","[[Our flight has been delayed by two hours.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Di hotel","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Memesan","[[I'd like to reserve a single room for two nights.]] / [[Do you have any rooms available?]]"],["Check-in","[[I have a reservation under the name Putri.]]"],["Menanyakan fasilitas","[[Is breakfast included?]] / [[What time is check-out?]] / [[Is there Wi-Fi in the room?]]"],["Meminta layanan","[[Could I have an extra towel, please?]] / [[Could you send someone to fix the air conditioner?]]"],["Check-out","[[I'd like to check out, please.]] / [[Could I have the bill?]]"],["Menyimpan bagasi","[[Could you keep my luggage until 3 p.m.?]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"boarding pass","id":"kartu naik pesawat","ex":"Please show your boarding pass."},{"en":"passport","id":"paspor","ex":"I forgot my passport."},{"en":"visa","id":"visa","ex":"Do I need a visa?"},{"en":"luggage / baggage","id":"bagasi","ex":"My luggage is lost."},{"en":"carry-on","id":"bagasi kabin","ex":"I only have a carry-on."},{"en":"gate","id":"gerbang keberangkatan","ex":"Go to Gate 12."},{"en":"delayed","id":"tertunda","ex":"The flight is delayed."},{"en":"itinerary","id":"jadwal perjalanan","ex":"Here's my itinerary."},{"en":"reservation","id":"pemesanan","ex":"I have a reservation."},{"en":"single / double room","id":"kamar single / double","ex":"A double room, please."},{"en":"check-in / check-out","id":"masuk / keluar hotel","ex":"Check-out is at noon."},{"en":"receipt","id":"bukti pembayaran","ex":"May I have a receipt?"},{"en":"expense claim","id":"klaim pengeluaran","ex":"Submit your expense claim."},{"en":"jet lag","id":"lelah akibat perbedaan zona waktu","ex":"I have jet lag."},{"en":"shuttle","id":"angkutan antar-jemput","ex":"Is there a shuttle to the hotel?"},{"en":"currency","id":"mata uang","ex":"Where can I change currency?"}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Transportasi dan arah","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Taksi","[[Could you take me to this address, please?]] / [[How long will it take?]]"],["Tarif","[[How much is the fare?]] / [[Could you use the meter, please?]]"],["Bertanya arah","[[Excuse me, how do I get to the station?]] / [[Is it far from here?]]"],["Memahami arah","[[Go straight, then turn left at the traffic light.]]"],["Transportasi umum","[[Which platform does the train to Osaka leave from?]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Menjamu rekan dari luar negeri","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Menyambut","[[Welcome to Jakarta! Did you have a good flight?]]"],["Membantu barang","[[Let me help you with your luggage.]]"],["Mengantar","[[I'll take you to your hotel. My driver is waiting.]]"],["Menawarkan makan","[[Would you like to try some local food?]] / [[Is there anything you can't eat?]]"],["Menjelaskan jadwal","[[Tomorrow, the meeting starts at 9. I'll pick you up at 8:30.]]"],["Memastikan nyaman","[[Please let me know if you need anything.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Itinerary dan klaim biaya","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Membaca jadwal","[[Departure: 08:15 — Arrival: 10:30]]"],["Menjelaskan rencana","[[On Monday, we're meeting the client. On Tuesday, we're visiting the factory.]]"],["Meminta bukti","[[Please keep all your receipts for the expense claim.]]"],["Menyebut batas","[[The claim must be submitted within seven days.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Sopan santun lintas budaya","text":"Jabat tangan yang tegas dan kontak mata umum di banyak negara, tetapi kebiasaan berbeda-beda. Datanglah **tepat waktu**, ucapkan **please** dan **thank you**, dan jika ragu, tanyakan dengan sopan: [[Is it okay if I ...?]]"},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Check-in di bandara","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Good morning. I'd like to check in for the flight to Singapore.","id":"Selamat pagi. Saya ingin check-in untuk penerbangan ke Singapura."},{"who":"Officer","en":"Certainly. May I see your passport and e-ticket, please?","id":"Tentu. Boleh saya lihat paspor dan tiket elektronik Anda?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Here you are. Could I have a window seat, please?","id":"Ini. Bolehkah saya dapat kursi dekat jendela?"},{"who":"Officer","en":"Sure. Do you have any bags to check in?","id":"Tentu. Apakah Anda punya bagasi untuk dititipkan?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Just this one. And this is my carry-on.","id":"Hanya yang ini. Dan ini bagasi kabin saya."},{"who":"Officer","en":"Here is your boarding pass. Boarding starts at 9:30 at Gate 12.","id":"Ini kartu naik Anda. Boarding dimulai pukul 9:30 di Gerbang 12."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Check-in hotel","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Good evening. I have a reservation under the name Putri.","id":"Selamat malam. Saya punya pemesanan atas nama Putri."},{"who":"Staff","en":"Yes, Ms. Putri. A single room for two nights. May I see your passport?","id":"Ya, Ibu Putri. Satu kamar single untuk dua malam. Boleh saya lihat paspor Anda?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Of course. Is breakfast included, and what time is check-out?","id":"Tentu. Apakah sarapan termasuk, dan pukul berapa check-out?"},{"who":"Staff","en":"Breakfast is included from 6 to 10. Check-out is at noon. Your room is 508.","id":"Sarapan termasuk dari pukul 6 sampai 10. Check-out pukul dua belas siang. Kamar Anda 508."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Thank you. Could you send someone to fix the air conditioner? It isn't working.","id":"Terima kasih. Bisakah Anda mengirim orang untuk memperbaiki AC? Tidak berfungsi."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 3: Menyambut tamu dari luar negeri","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Welcome to Jakarta, Mr. Smith! Did you have a good flight?","id":"Selamat datang di Jakarta, Pak Smith! Apakah penerbangan Anda menyenangkan?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Yes, thank you. It was long, but comfortable. I have a little jet lag.","id":"Ya, terima kasih. Lama, tetapi nyaman. Saya sedikit jet lag."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Let me help you with your luggage. My driver is waiting outside.","id":"Biar saya bantu membawa bagasi Anda. Sopir saya menunggu di luar."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Tomorrow the meeting starts at 9. I'll pick you up at 8:30. Please let me know if you need anything.","id":"Besok rapat dimulai pukul 9. Saya akan menjemput Anda pukul 8:30. Beri tahu saya jika Anda butuh sesuatu."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Bandara: [[check in]], [[boarding pass]], [[gate]], [[Could I have a window seat?]]","Hotel: [[I have a reservation under ...]], [[Is breakfast included?]], [[What time is check-out?]]","Arah: [[How do I get to ...?]], [[Go straight, then turn left.]]","Menjamu tamu: [[Did you have a good flight?]], [[Let me help you with your luggage.]]","Simpan semua **receipt** untuk klaim pengeluaran."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["boarding pass","kartu naik pesawat"],["luggage","bagasi"],["gate","gerbang keberangkatan"],["delayed","tertunda"],["itinerary","jadwal perjalanan"]],"exp":"Kosakata bandara.","k":"58e41bf7"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata hotel dengan artinya:","pairs":[["reservation","pemesanan"],["check-out","keluar hotel"],["receipt","bukti pembayaran"],["shuttle","antar-jemput"]],"exp":"Kosakata hotel.","k":"a9bf83f0"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan situasi dengan ungkapan:","pairs":[["memilih kursi","Could I have a window seat?"],["tanya gerbang","Which gate does it leave from?"],["memesan kamar","I'd like to reserve a single room."],["minta tagihan","Could I have the bill?"]],"exp":"Ungkapan perjalanan.","k":"f907235e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk check-in penerbangan adalah...","options":["I'd like to check in for the flight to Singapore.","Give ticket.","Fly me.","Singapore."],"answer":0,"exp":"Check-in.","k":"b6cf8e6f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan meminta kursi dekat jendela adalah...","options":["Could I have a window seat, please?","Window me.","I take window.","Seat window."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"2a3c2617"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban untuk \"What's the purpose of your visit?\" adalah...","options":["I'm here on business.","I like yellow.","At 9 a.m.","By taxi."],"answer":0,"exp":"Business trip.","k":"cb03f585"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan menanyakan sarapan adalah...","options":["Is breakfast included?","Is breakfast hungry?","Breakfast is you?","Breakfast who?"],"answer":0,"exp":"included.","k":"80ee34e2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan menanyakan jam check-out adalah...","options":["What time is check-out?","When is check?","Where is out?","Who checks?"],"answer":0